[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17761.11, "timestamp": "04:56:01", "text": "最近我一直在说W，很多时候都是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17762.67, "timestamp": "04:56:02", "text": "就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.27, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "伊娜，是的，我一直在看……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17788.07, "timestamp": "04:56:28", "text": "很多我想用一个词来表达的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17790.43, "timestamp": "04:56:30", "text": "呃，就像短语一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17794.27, "timestamp": "04:56:34", "text": "我们自己也为了dos，嗯等等，我刚才是不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17799.28, "timestamp": "04:56:39", "text": "你们叫你们干什么？索尼克说的是什么？等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.51, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17804.59, "timestamp": "04:56:44", "text": "社区名称我们可以更改"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17806.67, "timestamp": "04:56:46", "text": "期间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17810.47, "timestamp": "04:56:50", "text": "我没等我反应过来，我刚才在想什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17812.11, "timestamp": "04:56:52", "text": "那"}]